<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">crystalline-decanter</ansi> (jewelcrafting recipe)

A masterwork vessel of crystal-clear glass fused with gemstone
dust and sealed with chrysalis energy. Potions stored in a
crystalline decanter age at a quarter of the normal rate --
the finest preservation money can buy.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       jewelcrafting (minimum 20)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     jeweler bench
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> raw gem (x1), chrysalis shard (x1),
                 glass vial (x2)

